    description: "Seedlings never shoot: they close in and charge prow first like a [[ship:grown_rammer]], from every side at once. Each one breaks quickly, but its [[part:ram_prow|prow]] and [[part:grown_ganglion|ganglion]] heal if you leave it, so finish one before turning to the next.",
    lore: "Somewhere in every grove there is a shoal of them, too young to keep still.",
